# Normalise text to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# `text=auto` alone normalises the repository but checks out native line endings, which on
# Windows means CRLF - and since this tree is LF on disk, every one of 534 files then reads as
# modified immediately after a clone or a rebase, with no content difference. `eol=lf` pins both
# sides so the tree stays clean. MSVC compiles LF sources without complaint.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.cpp   text
*.h     text
*.py    text
*.md    text
*.json  text
*.asm   text

*.png   binary
*.dds   binary
*.ar    binary
*.bnd   binary
*.bms   binary
